rk times, and the king enforced order and discipline under the harshest of terms.  Any who deviated were punished, any who disagreed were repressed, and many disappeared without a trace into his numerous prisons.  All must be loyal to the crown or suffer dearly.  When he died without heir the crown was lost and his kingdom fell into chaos.","source_tag":"_t","target":"半身人国王洛帕曾佩戴这顶王冠，他曾于黄昏纪统治着纳格尔大陆。那是黑暗的年代，国王通过最残暴的手段执行他的命令和法律。任何违背他思想的人都被严厉的惩罚，任何反对他的人都被无情的镇压，这些人大部分都无声无息的消失了——被关进了国王那不计其数的监狱里。所有人都必须表示忠诚或者付出昂贵的代价。他在没有子嗣的情况下死去，皇冠失踪的同时他的国家也陷入了混乱。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6d9269f9c2f4d946ed4f8a64d2b124f8253cb8a31b77b332f7abc1e987394e96","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"fd277348ef4534ef6623ce6cecf0730ed155af9dc4f72cfccc947f4d818ef80f","logical_entry_identity":"b0c8392f6612e18438d5a9a565846ed8951991ad2ff99447ad846473890f0661","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"It is a ghostly form with eyes that haunt you.","source_tag":"_t","target":"它呈幽灵形态，眼睛一直盯着你。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2f824109c19eebdc15b8717dc5ab2ce28807db2223ccab922f19be11e6106f4b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"fd29006f43e97622d3f5082fb4d8abb915e0e866cb6a2181a09c46fe1082aed3","logical_entry_identity":"11626e4e0ee927440d87cd29a5f9805f0ae1d105e614d22d714b0a06ad24b278","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#Target# is pulled toward #Source#!","source_tag":"logCombat","target":"#Target#被拉向#Source#！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1559a76bda197956ea7b31b683d7866e1becdfc4ad815b5ebd36bf8aeb0bf570","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"fd2afcd1f7684deaf6a721eab8016d123e53fbb46bed1927f47500d7a7930337","logical_entry_identity":"dbaa8844fe29e8ef3a8f00d89a3917921eec890869203c563de995e739b178f5","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Their most important stats are: Dexterity and Cunning","source_tag":"_t","target":"他们最重要的属性是：敏捷和灵巧"}],"fixed_source_identity":"commit:624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63","rendered_briefing":"WP2-Lite surface scree